---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
const sections=[["Current documented status","The design reserves placements for possible future advertising. Those placements are documented as hidden without live ads; a reserved slot alone does not imply a sponsor, active campaign or advertising income. This is not a substitute for an independent check of current third-party scripts."],["Future advertising","If advertising is enabled, visible commercial placements will be clearly identified and separated from editorial content. Privacy and consent requirements applicable to actual providers must be reviewed."],["Affiliate links","If an article or commercial section includes links that may earn a commission, that relationship will be disclosed in context. Paid recommendations will not be presented as independent evaluations."],["Editorial separation","Advertisers cannot rewrite the original poem, its verses or documentary references. A commercial relationship is not proof that a historical or literary claim is accurate."],["Related policies","Read the <a href='/en/privacy/'>Privacy Policy</a> and <a href='/en/terms/'>Terms of Use</a>."]];
---
<Base lang="en-US" pageType="WebPage" title="Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure — MARTINFIERRO.ORG" description="Editorial independence and transparency rules for possible advertising and commercial partnerships.">
<article class="legal-en"><nav class="crumb"><a href="/en/">English edition</a> / Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure</nav><p class="eyebrow">EDITORIAL INFORMATION · 1 NOVEMBER 2026</p><h1>Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure</h1><p class="lead">Editorial independence and transparency rules for possible advertising and commercial partnerships.</p>{sections.map(([heading,body],i)=><section><h2>{heading}</h2><p set:html={body}/></section>)}<footer><p>This English page describes the same underlying project as its Spanish counterpart. In case of a material discrepancy, consult the original project documentation and request an editorial correction; neither version is represented as independently certified legal advice.</p><a href="/en/contact/">Contact and corrections</a></footer></article>
<style>.legal-en{max-width:960px;margin:28px auto 90px;color:#33291f}.legal-en a{color:#86402b;text-underline-offset:4px}.crumb,.eyebrow{font:.79rem/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif}.eyebrow{font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#95513b}.legal-en h1{font:600 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.4rem)/1.1 Georgia,serif}.lead{font:1.22rem/1.68 Georgia,serif}.legal-en section{padding:23px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #c9b69e}.legal-en h2{font:600 1.9rem/1.25 Georgia,serif}.legal-en p{font:1.06rem/1.77 Georgia,serif}.legal-en footer{background:#efe3d5;padding:22px;margin-top:30px}@media(max-width:700px){.legal-en{padding:0 12px}}</style>
